*{{gutenberg author | id=Elizabeth_Barrett_Browning | name=Elizabeth Barrett Browning}}
*[http://www.quotesandpoem.com/poems/PoetsAndPoems/Browning Poetry, Letters and Quotes by Elizabeth Barrett Browning]
